-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_5/p78 Source list: a provision of the Women's Work Law, a regulation or a circular the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_5/p79 Source list: a provision of the Women's Work Law, a regulation or a circular the sub-section rests on.
