-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p109 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p110 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p111 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p112 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p113 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
