-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p115 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p116 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_7/p117 Source list: a circular or a compilation the sub-section rests on.

§§ `1.25.8 היעדרויות לרגל לימודים ובחינות`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p1 Sub-heading ("absence for studies").

DECLARE `studies action` IS ONE OF
    `request unpaid leave of one workday a week`
    `concentrate the work hours into five days`
    `give written consent to the concentration`
    `request paid leave for study tours`
    `deliver the university's confirmation of the tour`
    `deduct a day's salary`
    `hire a paid substitute`
    `return the additional exam days`
    `notify the principal of the exam date`

-- ¶1: employees studying as regular students in the last year of a higher-
-- education degree in education, psychology or a school subject may ask the
-- district manager for unpaid leave of one workday a week. ¶2, "in addition":
-- no unpaid leave in teaching hours — the teacher concentrates the hours in 5
-- days, with the principal's written consent. F-1.25-w: the two give opposite
-- answers to whether the day off is unpaid; read: ¶2 governs a teacher's
-- teaching hours (the day is won by concentrating them, unpaid leave covers
-- only hours that are not teaching hours).
@desc A student teacher's week, as section 1.25.8's first paragraphs ask about it.
DECLARE `student's week` HAS
    `in the last year as a regular student` IS A BOOLEAN
    `studies education, psychology or a school subject` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaching hours on the day off`         IS A NUMBER
    `other work hours on the day off`       IS A NUMBER
    `the principal consented in writing`    IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p2
GIVEN w IS A `student's week`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may ask for a weekly day of unpaid leave for studies` w IF
    w's `in the last year as a regular student` AND w's `studies education, psychology or a school subject`

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p2
GIVEN w IS A `student's week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `unpaid hours of the study day under paragraph 1` w IS
    IF `may ask for a weekly day of unpaid leave for studies` w
    THEN w's `teaching hours on the day off` PLUS w's `other work hours on the day off`
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p3
GIVEN w IS A `student's week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `unpaid hours of the study day` w IS
    IF `may ask for a weekly day of unpaid leave for studies` w AND w's `the principal consented in writing`
    THEN w's `other work hours on the day off`
    ELSE `unpaid hours of the study day under paragraph 1` w

`a final-year student with 6 teaching hours on the day` MEANS
    `student's week` TRUE TRUE 6 0 TRUE
`the two paragraphs disagree on whether the study day is unpaid` MEANS
    NOT (`unpaid hours of the study day under paragraph 1` `a final-year student with 6 teaching hours on the day`
         EQUALS `unpaid hours of the study day` `a final-year student with 6 teaching hours on the day`)
#ASSERT `the two paragraphs disagree on whether the study day is unpaid`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p4 Sub-heading ("absence for study tours").

-- Geography tours: a teacher studying geography at a university and teaching
-- 6 days a week is given paid leave for the course's tours and field work, if
-- still owing tours after 4 tour days in the school's vacations — up to 3 paid
-- days a year, in at most 2 study years, asked of the supervisor through the
-- principal at least 3 weeks ahead; the university's confirmation goes with
-- the principal's monthly attendance report, or a day's salary is deducted; a
-- paid substitute may be hired. History tours get no leave.
@desc A request for paid leave for study tours.
DECLARE `tour request` HAS
    `studies geography at a university`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `teaches six days a week`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `tour days already in the vacations`    IS A NUMBER
    `still owes tours`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `paid tour days asked this year`        IS A NUMBER
    `study years with paid tour leave so far` IS A NUMBER
    `days ahead the request is made`        IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p5 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p6 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p7 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p8 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p11
GIVEN t IS A `tour request`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `paid tour days given` t IS
    IF     t's `studies geography at a university`
       AND t's `teaches six days a week`
       AND t's `tour days already in the vacations` AT LEAST 4
       AND t's `still owes tours`
       AND t's `study years with paid tour leave so far` LESS THAN 2
       AND t's `days ahead the request is made` AT LEAST 21
    THEN min (t's `paid tour days asked this year`) 3
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p9
GIVEN `delivered the university's confirmation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `studies action`
DECIDE `confirming a tour day` `delivered the university's confirmation` IS
    IF `delivered the university's confirmation`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         MUST  `deduct a day's salary`
         WITHIN 30

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p10
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `studies action`
DECIDE `a substitute for a touring teacher` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MAY   `hire a paid substitute`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p12 Sub-heading ("absence for examinations").

-- Examinations 1: a permanent teacher studying for a degree at a post-
-- secondary institution has 3 paid days for examinations held on a day of
-- duty at school, and 3 more paid days to be returned in coordination with
-- the principal, on certificates and notice of the date. 2: in official
-- institutions, paid leave for the Ministry's examinations, on the teacher-
-- training department's official notice, when they fall in school hours.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p13 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p14 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p15 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p16 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p17 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p18
GIVEN `is permanent` IS A BOOLEAN, `studies for a degree` IS A BOOLEAN, `exams on school duty days` IS A NUMBER, `certificates and notice given` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `paid exam days not to be returned` `is permanent` `studies for a degree` `exams on school duty days` `certificates and notice given` IS
    IF `is permanent` AND `studies for a degree` AND `certificates and notice given`
    THEN min `exams on school duty days` 3
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p16
`additional paid exam days, to be returned` MEANS 3

@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p19
GIVEN `in an official institution` IS A BOOLEAN, `official notice from the teacher-training department` IS A BOOLEAN, `the exam falls in school hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid leave for a Ministry examination` `in an official institution` `official notice from the teacher-training department` `the exam falls in school hours` IF
    `in an official institution` AND `official notice from the teacher-training department` AND `the exam falls in school hours`

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p20 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p21 Source list: an elementary-education circular.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p22 Source list: an elementary-education circular.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p23 Source list: elementary-education circulars.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p24 Source list: a standing committee's decision.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p25 Source list: a circular and a letter.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_8/p26 Source list: a letter of the assistant for conditions of service.

#ASSERT `paid tour days given` (`tour request` TRUE TRUE 4 TRUE 5 0 25) EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `paid tour days given` (`tour request` TRUE TRUE 2 TRUE 5 0 25) EQUALS 0

§§ `1.25.9 היעדרות לרגל שירות מילואים`

DECLARE `reserve action` IS ONE OF
    `apply to the principal at once`
    `fill the request form for the coordination committee`
    `attach a letter of recommendation`
    `sign the undertaking to serve in the vacation`
    `forward the documents to the town officer`
    `send a copy to the district office`

-- 3: a teacher of a non-Jewish school serving in reserve in that school's long
-- vacations is paid twice (as reservist and by the employer), by that school's
-- vacations and not the Jewish schools'; from 1.9.91.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_3 akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_3/p2
GIVEN `reserve days in the school's own long vacations` IS A NUMBER, `date` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days paid twice to a non-Jewish school's teacher` `reserve days in the school's own long vacations` `date` IS
    IF `date` AT LEAST 19910901 THEN `reserve days in the school's own long vacations` ELSE 0

-- 4: called up while the school cannot run its lessons without the teacher,
-- the teacher applies to the principal at once; the principal fills the form
-- for the reserve-coordination committee at the town officer, adds a letter
-- on how essential the request is, signs; the teacher signs an undertaking
-- to serve in the vacation instead and copies the movement order; the
-- principal sends it all to the town officer at least two weeks before the
-- reporting date (at once on a sudden call-up) and a copy to the district
-- office; the decision comes through the town officer. Time in days before reporting.
@ref akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_a akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_b akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_c akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_d akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_e akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_f
GIVEN `days from the order to reporting` IS A NUMBER, `a sudden call-up` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `reserve action`
DECIDE `asking to defer reserve duty` `days from the order to reporting` `a sudden call-up` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `apply to the principal at once`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE    (PARTY `the teaching employee`
              MUST  `sign the undertaking to serve in the vacation`
              WITHIN 1)
          RAND
             (PARTY `the school principal`
              MUST  `forward the documents to the town officer`
              WITHIN (IF `a sudden call-up` THEN 1 ELSE max 0 (`days from the order to reporting` MINUS 14))
              HENCE (PARTY `the school principal`
                     MUST  `send a copy to the district office`
                     WITHIN 1)
              LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "section 1.25.9(4)(c): the documents reach the town officer at least two weeks before reporting")

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_f/p2 Title of sample form 1; the form's text is not in the corpus.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_f/p3 Title of sample form 2; the form's text is not in the corpus.
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9__para_4__subpara_f/p4 Title of sample form 3; the form's text is not in the corpus.

-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_1ב__sec_1_25__ssec_1_25_9/p2 Source list: a Director-General's circular.
